  "subQuests": [
    {
      "subId": "7618601",
      "subQuestName": "Go to the Frostmoon Enclave to start the tea party",
      "sceneId": null,
      "locations": [],
      "dialogue": {
        "startDialogs": [
          "761860101"
        ],
        "dialogs": {
          "761860101": {
            "id": "761860101",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Lauma",
            "text": "...",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "761860102"
            ]
          },
          "761860102": {
            "id": "761860102",
            "speakerId": 1001,
            "speakerName": "Marionette",
            "text": "...",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "761860103"
            ]
          },
          "761860103": {
            "id": "761860103",
            "speakerId": 1001,
            "speakerName": "Marionette",
            "text": "...So, how have the Frostmoon Scions been faring lately?",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "761860104"
            ]
          },
          "761860104": {
            "id": "761860104",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Lauma",
            "text": "Quite well. The return of the Moon Goddess has strengthened our resolve to walk our given path.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "761860105"
            ]
          },
          "761860105": {
            "id": "761860105",
            "speakerId": 1001,
            "speakerName": "Marionette",
            "text": "Really? Well, that's good to hear.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "761860106"
            ]
          },
          "761860106": {
            "id": "761860106",
            "speakerId": 1001,
            "speakerName": "Marionette",
            "text": "...",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "761860107"
            ]
          },
          "761860107": {
            "id": "761860107",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Lauma",
            "text": "...",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "761860108"
            ]
          },
          "761860108": {
            "id": "761860108",
            "speakerId": 1001,
            "speakerName": "Marionette",
            "text": "Hah... I suppose we really do have nothing to talk about.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "761860109"
            ]
          },
          "761860109": {
            "id": "761860109",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Lauma",
            "text": "I'm afraid that... is because there's far too much history between the Frostmoon Scions and the Fatui.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "761860110"
            ]
          },
          "761860110": {
            "id": "761860110",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Lauma",
            "text": "Speaking purely for myself, I'm grateful for your efforts in protecting Nod-Krai and welcoming back the Moon Goddess, Miss Sandrone. But as for your associates...",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "761860111"
            ]
          },
          "761860111": {
            "id": "761860111",
            "speakerId": 1001,
            "speakerName": "Marionette",
            "text": "I understand. For various reasons, we failed to establish friendly relations — or even mutually beneficial ones.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "761860112"
            ]
          },
          "761860112": {
            "id": "761860112",
            "speakerId": 1001,
            "speakerName": "Marionette",
            "text": "But the Fatui no longer seek to take anything from the Frostmoon Scions, and I have reminded my subordinates not to make things difficult.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "761860113"
            ]
          },
          "761860113": {
            "id": "761860113",
            "speakerId": 1001,
            "speakerName": "Marionette",
            "text": "From where I stand, seeing as we're neighbors, even if we can't coexist in perfect harmony, it would be nice if we could at least treat each other with mutual respect.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "761860114"
            ]
          },
          "761860114": {
            "id": "761860114",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Lauma",
            "text": "I'm afraid that will take time...",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "761860115"
            ]
          },
          "761860115": {
            "id": "761860115",
            "speakerId": 1001,
            "speakerName": "Marionette",
            "text": "Undoubtedly. But we can start by taking one small step at a time. Would you like to try this herbal tea I prepared?",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "761860116"
            ]
          },
          "761860116": {
            "id": "761860116",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Lauma",
            "text": "Oh? Herbal tea...?",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "761860117"
            ]
          },
          "761860117": {
            "id": "761860117",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Lauma",
            "text": "Hmm... Such rich flavor. Did you brew this the Frostmoon Scions' way? Most outsiders I've met don't like our tea. How did you...",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "761860118"
            ]
          },
          "761860118": {
            "id": "761860118",
            "speakerId": 1001,
            "speakerName": "Marionette",
            "text": "By learning. And showing respect.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "761860119"
            ]
          },
          "761860119": {
            "id": "761860119",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Lauma",
            "text": "Hah... Not a bad first step.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "761860120"
            ]
          },
          "761860120": {
            "id": "761860120",
            "speakerId": 1001,
            "speakerName": "Marionette",
            "text": "I hope it suits your tastes.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "761860121"
            ]
          },
          "761860121": {
            "id": "761860121",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Lauma",
            "text": "I like it a lot.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "761860122"
            ]
          },
          "761860122": {
            "id": "761860122",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Lauma",
            "text": "Amicable exchanges over hot pots of tea have always been a great way to strike up friendly relations.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "761860123"
            ]
          },
          "761860123": {
            "id": "761860123",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Lauma",
            "text": "I have a feeling this time will be no exception."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "subId": "7618602",
      "subQuestName": "Go to the Frostmoon Enclave to start the tea party",
      "sceneId": null,
      "locations": [],
      "dialogue": {
        "startDialogs": [
          "761860201"
        ],
        "dialogs": {
          "761860201": {
            "id": "761860201",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Lauma",
            "text": "A truly delicious herbal tea, Miss Sandrone. It's like I can taste your sincerity.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "761860202"
            ]
          },
          "761860202": {
            "id": "761860202",
            "speakerId": 1001,
            "speakerName": "Marionette",
            "text": "(Let's sit like this for a little while longer.)",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "761860204"
            ]
          },
          "761860204": {
            "id": "761860204",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Lauma",
            "text": "Alright. Next time, I'll have to invite you for tea."
          }
        }
      }
    },
